</section>
<main>
  <section class="pt-24 pb-16 max-md:pt-14 max-md:pb-10"><div class={wrap}>
    <div class="mb-9 flex items-end justify-between gap-10 max-md:flex-col max-md:items-start max-md:gap-3"><h2 class="reveal text-title tracking-tight max-md:text-title-sm">The work</h2><p class="reveal max-w-intro text-intro leading-normal text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">Real sites in production, on EmDash, kept up by people. Open one to see its record.</p></div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-7 max-md:grid-cols-1">
      <a class="ticket tilt reveal" href="/work/saltwater"><div class="ticket-pic"><div class="ticket-still"><span>Saltwater</span></div></div><div class="ticket-tear"><span class="ticket-stub">SITE Nº 01</span><div class="kind-line">Publication · EmDash</div><h3 class="mt-1 mb-2 text-heading leading-natural max-md:text-heading-sm">Saltwater</h3><p class="text-base leading-normal text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">Sydney's coastal walks, walked, timed and written up.</p><div class="mt-3.5 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5"><span class="chip">5 Pinies</span><span class="chip">Model on the record</span><span class="chip">Steps by hand on the record</span></div></div></a>
      <a class="ticket tilt reveal" href="/work/brew-guide"><div class="ticket-pic"><div class="ticket-still"><span>Brew Guide</span></div></div><div class="ticket-tear"><span class="ticket-stub">SITE Nº 02</span><div class="kind-line">Docs · EmDash</div><h3 class="mt-1 mb-2 text-heading leading-natural max-md:text-heading-sm">Brew Guide</h3><p class="text-base leading-normal text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">Better coffee at home, one method at a time.</p><div class="mt-3.5 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5"><span class="chip">5 Pinies</span><span class="chip">Model on the record</span><span class="chip">Steps by hand on the record</span></div></div></a>
    </div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="pt-8 pb-24"><div class={wrap}>
    <h2 class="reveal text-title tracking-tight max-md:text-title-sm">How we work</h2>
    <ol class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-4 gap-5 max-md:grid-cols-1">
